<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  The device check, plus the activity labels the launcher and the task switcher show.

  Translators: this screen is the earliest statement the product makes about how good a
  measurement on this phone can be, so its verdicts are precise on purpose. "Supported,
  without depth" is not the same claim as "supported", and the difference is what the user
  is being told to expect.
-->
